window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Some secrets can’t stay buried.</p> <p>When I first attended Wolf Moon Academy, the Blood Council and heirs did everything they could to make Liam reject me. I was beneath their status, but much to their chagrin...I persevered.</p> <p>Now that we’re officially bound, they’re determined to get rid of me. After each failed attempt, they up the stakes. Nothing is off the table.</p> <p>But I'm determined to take back what is rightfully mine and do what they refuse to do - protect the packs...as long as they don't kill me first.</p> <p>If you can't get enough of books by K.F. Breene, Kelly St. Claire, Annette Marie, Shannon Mayer, Leia Stone, Jaymin Eve, and Laura Thalassa, then you'll love this paranormal romance.</p> <p>Scroll up and one click <i>Blood Legacy</i> today.</p> <p>***Please note this is not reverse harem, and there are instances of bullying.</p>"; 
